    <title>E19.达沃斯：🏔雪山下的「不完美」修行与高能社交体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67da649add11f9c8c1a06430</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67da649add11f9c8c1a06430</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>🎧 本期概要</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在瑞士达沃斯世界经济论坛的精英漩涡中，Lily与内森从迟到的合作方转为和平愿景传播者。拆解高压社交中的夫妻搭档特种兵模式，记录与藏传仁波切的商业修行对话，揭开顶级名利场「完美人设」背后的返璞归真哲学。</span></p><span></span><h4><span>​⏳ 概览</span></h4><span></span><p><strong><span>开场｜雪山特种兵报到</span></strong><br><span>闯入世界经济论坛：国家政要、AI科技大佬的高能社交的初体验</span><br><span>达沃斯生存法则：名片写“茶叶贩子”比CEO更吸睛</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>高能社交实录</span></strong><br><span>和平晚宴翻车记：冒名顶替综合征发作</span><br><span>Lily的茶道破冰术：用东方茶叶瓦解西方精英式尬聊</span><br><span>达沃斯奇遇：近距离见到波兰总统谈战争与和平</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商业修行场</span></strong><br><span>迟到危机：与藏传高僧仁波切相约迟到，学会真诚的道歉</span><br><span>愿景穿透力：“最后一口气也要为和平燃烧”的雪山宣言</span><br><span>商业修行启示录：大师用场域做事，普通人用利益捆绑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>亲密关系战地模式</span></strong><br><span>夫妻Social分工：Lily=情绪急救包，内森=社交冲锋枪</span><br><span>深夜复盘金句：“我们不是夫妻，是特种兵两性搭档”</span></p><span></span><h4><span>​</span><strong><span>💡 关键点</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span>🌀 ​</span><strong><span>​「高能社交的AB面」​</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>顶级名利场的隐形规则：越松弛越高级</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>身份标签博弈：茶叶贩子 vs 创业CEO的人设实验</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🔥 ​</span><strong><span>​「不完美合作哲学」​</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>迟到引发的商业课：真诚＞完美预案</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>仁波切启示录：“你只是愿景的通道，而非掌控者”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>💼 ​</span><strong><span>​「夫妻特种兵手册」​</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>战场通信密码：1句话化解冒充者综合征</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>拒绝贤内助陷阱：互为攻守搭档的协作系统</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🌱 ​</span><strong><span>​「生命愿景重构」​</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>从“活成百万富翁”到“为和平燃烧”的价值观地震</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>达沃斯后遗症：用“最后一口气”思维重启人生</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h4><span>​</span><strong><span>🎙️ 主播</span></strong></h4><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Lily：写作者、能量疗愈师、小红书 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54ffc51e2e1d93696bf6f7ed?xsec_token=YB7KRUhYq6IUvZZOAsK0s70ezIQZzJtjFfFPHce49llfU=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6296e26e00000000210213fb&amp;apptime=1738430153&amp;share_id=c659ab708a1448f89db3cc443b05380d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54ffc51e2e1d93696bf6f7ed?xsec_token=YB7KRUhYq6IUvZZOAsK0s70ezIQZzJtjFfFPHce49llfU=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6296e26e00000000210213fb&amp;apptime=1738430153&amp;share_id=c659ab708a1448f89db3cc443b05380d"><span>Organic Lily</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>内森：蜕变生命教练，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66deb846cd37bf4b1845dd17" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66deb846cd37bf4b1845dd17"><span>【森心合一】</span></a><span>主播</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h4><span>​</span><strong><span>📩 互动话题</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span>评论区留言分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏔️ 如果你去达沃斯，会在名片上写什么身份标签？</span><br><span>🕊️ 你经历过哪些“不完美却成功”的合作瞬间？</span></p><span></span><h4><span>​**✅ 订阅提醒**</span></h4><span></span><p><span>点击订阅，每周三晚解锁「半梦半醒」跨国床聊</span></p>]]></description>
