k&amp;appuid=6296e26e00000000210213fb&amp;apptime=1738430153&amp;share_id=c659ab708a1448f89db3cc443b05380d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54ffc51e2e1d93696bf6f7ed?xsec_token=YB7KRUhYq6IUvZZOAsK0s70ezIQZzJtjFfFPHce49llfU=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6296e26e00000000210213fb&amp;apptime=1738430153&amp;share_id=c659ab708a1448f89db3cc443b05380d"><span>Organic Lily</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>内森：蜕变生命教练，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66deb846cd37bf4b1845dd17" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66deb846cd37bf4b1845dd17"><span>【森心合一】</span></a><span>主播</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📩 </span><strong><span>互动</span></strong><br><span>「你有过“越安稳越窒息”的体验吗？留言分享你的轨道突围故事」</span></p><span></span><p><span>✅ </span><strong><span>订阅提醒</span></strong><br><span>点击订阅，每周三晚解锁「半梦半醒」床聊哲学</span></p>]]></description>
