    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Feb 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期概要</span></strong><br><span>本期Lily与内森躺在香港铜锣湾的精致奢华酒店里，从消费体验切入，探讨了金钱观迭代、自由职业者的精神困境，以及如何通过“体验券思维”重构丰盛人生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳ </span><strong><span>概览</span></strong><br><span>开场｜半梦半醒的旅行创作日常</span><br><span>酒店观察｜艺术感如何重塑价值认知</span><br><span>自我觉察｜从“配得感缺失”到建立消费原则</span><br><span>能量管理｜为什么住贵酒店才能做好战略？</span><br><span>致命自由｜不上班后为何陷入存在主义危机</span><br><span>名利悖论｜想做觉醒者却渴望“名利”的矛盾</span><br><span>终极答案｜金钱是体验券，丰盛是选择力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 本期金句</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🌱「钱是地球游戏的体验券，灵魂追求丰富而非单一」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>💸「特种兵旅行vs沉浸式体验：榨干与享受的本质差异」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🌀「由俭入奢易？真正的丰盛是能安住任何状态」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>⚖️「致死量自由：离开KPI轨道后的精神旷野症」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🎯「当我们追求新星榜时，到底在害怕失去什么？」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️ </span><strong><span>主播</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Lily：写作者、能量疗愈师、小红书 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54ffc51e2e1d93696bf6f7ed?xsec_token=YB7KRUhYq6IUvZZOAsK0s70ezIQZzJtjFfFPHce49llfU=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6296e26e00000000210213fb&amp;apptime=1738430153&amp;share_id=c659ab708a1448f89db3cc443b05380d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54ffc51e2e1d93696bf6f7ed?xsec_token=YB7KRUhYq6IUvZZOAsK0s70ezIQZzJtjFfFPHce49llfU=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6296e26e00000000210213fb&amp;apptime=1738430153&amp;share_id=c659ab708a1448f89db3cc443b05380d"><span>Organic Lily</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>内森：蜕变生命教练，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66deb846cd37bf4b1845dd17" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66deb846cd37bf4b1845dd17"><span>【森心合一】</span></a><span>主播</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📩 </span><strong><span>互动</span></strong><br><span>「你为哪些奢华体验花的钱，回过头来看觉得超值？私信或评论区告诉我们→ 」</span></p><span></span><p><span>✅