    <title>E14.我们都诞生在欢愉之间，重新理解亲密</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668295b7077b88831b7cd3df</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668295b7077b88831b7cd3df</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这次节目是接着上期，我们又再次找到了Shiva 老师，来了一次密宗私教，真正去体验更深度的学习。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这次对话里，我们会分享一些夫妻生活的技巧，如何与对方做身体链接，重新理解亲密，怎么更好的做自我接纳，达到更高的幸福层次。在唱诵和密宗的支持下，创造一种灵魂伴侣的链接。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目适合想要更深度链接的情侣，正在亲密关系中，或者想要获得高质量关系的单身伙伴来听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有任何问题，欢迎留言提问。</span></p><span></span><p><span>传送门🚪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 巴厘岛密宗私教体验经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> 亲密关系中的隐形边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 亲密中抚触的技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> 我们都诞生在欢愉之间，你的欢愉在哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 唱诵咒语，让神话意像具身化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">33:19</a> 神性不来自于神，而来自于爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> 灵魂结婚：合作优于竞争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2625">43:45</a> 一位墨西哥好友关于“性”疗愈的经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3133">52:13</a> 好用的夫妻亲密小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3707">01:01:47</a> 不把亲密当做终点，指向更大的欢愉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4234">01:10:34</a> 两性的亲密，宛如闪电划开天空</span></p><span></span><p><span>🛏【听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入听友群</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加内森：n-xiaozhushou2</span></p><span></span><p><span>备注【半梦半醒】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsm9LT8FnWOANfSZjefYixuZBjiR.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
