    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期播客跟随Nathan 和 Lily一起去看看他们的乌布艺术馆之旅，我们在里面遇到了神奇的音乐家+按摩师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这次旅途里，我们也探索创作方法、不安全感、舒适圈、松弛感等话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有任何关于巴厘岛旅居和推荐，欢迎评论区留言，进听友群做交流🤝</span></p><span></span><p><span>传送门🚪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 乌布最值得去的艺术博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> 巴厘岛的艺术思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 弹奏音乐的赤脚按摩师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">24:47</a> 学会放松和找到舒适圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a> 巴厘岛神奇按摩体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 不明码标价的消费规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2403">40:03</a> 摸树和探索自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3121">52:01</a> 先体验后创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3664">01:01:04</a> N&amp;L看艺术展的不同方法</span></p><span></span><p><span>🛏【听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入听友群</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加内森：n-xiaozhushou2</span></p><span></span><p><span>备注【半梦半醒】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsm9LT8FnWOANfSZjefYixuZBjiR.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
